{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_022ser_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_022ser_title", "source_sha256": "83fddd14741ce9ce83033788d43c958566c58b6adae18f97fc7b95161fca1731", "ja": "星梨花と舞台裏", "zh": "和星梨花在后台", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_022ser_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_022ser_synopsis", "source_sha256": "12224db63d29cb0a74781cef64f2418611bf6be4b33de16abb15a6c845d8552c", "ja": "星梨花との舞台裏の一幕です。", "zh": "这是与星梨花在舞台后台的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_022ser_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_022ser_1000_null", "source_sha256": "ddf9781bdf29a2b1573899355eed15bd0aeecc316f1666c08065353f8c01fac2", "ja": "―ツアーライブ　ゲネプロ終了後―", "zh": "——巡回演出 彩排结束后——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_022ser_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_022ser_1001_401pro", "source_sha256": "d5b7a91661ebec978c788ffe95c6480091a89decd63db94fd14311b8bcc1658a", "ja": "星梨花、お疲れさま。\nちょっと元気ないみたいだけど……、大丈夫か？", "zh": "星梨花，辛苦了。\n你好像有点没精神……没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_022ser_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_022ser_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "c56d4b16d8a8977760b05e6aa75b8018d4c0f13eb3f853f098eb8a1e2df4074c", "ja": "プロデューサーさん……。アイドルの\nダンスって、難しいですね。わたし、全然で……。", "zh": "制作人……偶像的舞蹈，真难啊。我完全不行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_022ser_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_022ser_1003_401pro", "source_sha256": "cb07be1186e147820f8dc4263d829da77dd1da5a8ad1f19d52bd7c931c0857b0", "ja": "やっぱり気にしてたのか……。たしかに、\nレベル高いよな。ダンスも周りの実力も。", "zh": "果然还是很在意啊……确实，舞蹈水平很高，周围人的实力也很强。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_022ser_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_022ser_1004_401pro", "source_sha256": "bf465bb94862f6a007124098431488ebeb0e4e0b595fa8a8f896d090c46f3385", "ja": "でも親ばかというか、プロデューサーばか？かも\nしれないけど、全然ダメってことは、全然ないと思う！", "zh": "不过，怎么说呢，可能我是个溺爱孩子的家长，或者说是个护短的制作人？但我觉得，你绝对不是完全不行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_022ser_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_022ser_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "adf8d6f6cfd75b42ef1e604e37e78059e61ceeaa3e9fa73b9618b99cab31e900", "ja": "そうでしょうか……。わたし、たくさん間違えちゃい\nました。特に最後のほう、こんがらがっちゃって……。", "zh": "是这样吗……我弄错了好多地方。尤其是最后一段，完全理不清了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_022ser_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_022ser_1006_401pro", "source_sha256": "fd141d8c4a576051271c39d9bc6a8c7dbf93c5f2ffee88565404a67965c0bb07", "ja": "そうだったな……。でもさ、間違えるまでは、\nすごく楽しそうだったじゃないか？", "zh": "是啊……不过在出错之前，不是一直都很开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_022ser_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_022ser_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "381c30514b515e8c4216c0af03f2a84f3e19d44c5c4cc3809a0245955930e520", "ja": "あ、はい、楽しかったです！\nダンスがみなさんとピッタリそろって、嬉しくて……！", "zh": "啊，是的，很开心！\n能和大家的舞步完美同步，我特别高兴……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_022ser_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_022ser_1008_401pro", "source_sha256": "b1bec8c23c0724d13a9a310ce64478e6d984debd89591304ba99b4ea5275ff72", "ja": "うん、こっちにも伝わってきた。\nそれがすごいと思う！", "zh": "嗯，我也感受到了。\n我觉得这点真的很厉害！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_022ser_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_022ser_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "17b7fe0ce692dce3bb3d30627d111bec112686a7965f0e9ec7f2a7961b4a693a", "ja": "えっ？　どうしてですか？", "zh": "咦？为什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_022ser_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_022ser_1010_401pro", "source_sha256": "999c8426f673881b4de448484befe4d2634fdb1cf59ce9fdc89906b1d3a237cf", "ja": "アイドルはやっぱり、気持ちを客席に伝えること、\n客席を巻き込むことが、一番大事だと思うんだ。", "zh": "我觉得，对偶像来说，最重要的果然还是把自己的心情传达给观众，让观众也参与进来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_022ser_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_022ser_1011_401pro", "source_sha256": "062295a8bf0e2cc512db088ee0ba0cc5ca1794dde506dd3010c64c5c8f858dc8", "ja": "振りはもう少し覚えないといけないけど、星梨花は\nちゃんと客席を巻き込めてる。自信もっていこう！", "zh": "舞蹈动作还得再记熟一点，不过星梨花已经能很好地调动观众了。要自信一点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_022ser_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_022ser_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "637dc7269fb0dc5c2047a5ca99c21536f13dcbc48170d4a32f832dca0a56510c", "ja": "……！　はいっ、ありがとうございます♪", "zh": "……！好的，非常感谢您♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_022ser_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_022ser_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "0aeb2897898f5020ff306440d229114e9ac0d30f0832defc2dccbf413ac7fd11", "ja": "わたし、ちょっぴり弱気になっちゃってました。\n最後まであきらめずに、頑張ってみますね！", "zh": "我刚才有点变得没自信了。\n我会坚持到最后不放弃，努力试试的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
